mobile/*/.pub-cache/
mobile/*/.pub/
mobile/*/build/

# Android Build Artifacts & Keys
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/release/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/captures/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/key.properties
**/android/app/key.properties
**/android/*.iml
**/*.iml

# iOS Build Artifacts & CocoaPods
**/ios/Flutter/App.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/app.fltparameter
**/ios/Pods/
